{title: Were You There}
{artist: African American spiritual}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 63}

Verse 1
[Eb]Were you there when they [Ab]crucified my [Eb]Lord?
Were you there when they [Bb]crucified my Lord?
[Eb]Oh, [Ab]sometimes it causes me to [Eb]tremble, [Cm]tremble, [Bb]tremble —
[Eb]were you there when they [Ab]cruci[Bb]fied my [Eb]Lord?

Verse 2
[Eb]Were you there when [Ab]they nailed [Eb]Him
to the tree? Were you [Bb]there when they
[Eb]nailed Him to the tree? [Bb]Were you
[Eb]there when they nailed Him [Ab]to the [Eb]tree?

Verse 3
[Eb]Were you there when [Ab]they pierced [Eb]Him
in the side? Were you [Bb]there when they
[Eb]pierced [Ab]Him in the side? [Eb]Oh! [Bb]Were you
[Eb]there when they pierced Him [Ab]in the [Eb]side?

Verse 4
[Eb]Were you there when the sun
refused to shine? Were [Bb]you there when
[Eb]the sun refused to shine? [Bb]Were you
[Eb]there when the sun [Ab]refused to [Eb]shine?

Verse 5
[Eb]Were you there when [Ab]they laid [Eb]Him
in the tomb? Were you [Bb]there when they
[Eb]laid Him in the tomb? [Bb]Were you
[Eb]there when they laid Him [Ab]in the [Eb]tomb?
